      "content": "Your feeling of being a discarded object is a powerful reflection of how deeply intertwined your identity was with your ability to produce. Instead of focusing on the *tools* that changed, consider how your life experience has provided a unique foundation for new forms of contribution. Perhaps the point isn't to keep doing the old work, but to find ways to leverage your wisdom in a different, less physically demanding capacity.",
